{"entry_id":"diary_20260319_001","entry_timestamp":"2026-03-19T00:00:00Z","raw_text":"Last night I couldn’t sleep, so I watched the rain on my window. My neighbor Marco knocked at 6am and asked if I wanted his old bike. I told him I’d think about it, but I felt nervous for some reason. Around 9, I noticed the bike’s chain was tangled, and I could smell rust. I spent an hour with the chain, and then my cat Juniper curled up beside me. Marco returned with tea and said he was sure it would run after a little oil. Then I decided to clean everything, even the bell that wouldn’t stop clanking. At noon, I realized the brakes were worn, so I made a note to replace them. Later, I heard Juniper meow like she meant it, and I laughed. After that, I finally fixed the seat and felt proud until the sun started fading.","nersamples":[{"tokens":["Last","night","I","couldn’t","sleep,","so","I","watched","the","rain","on","my","window."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","I-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-ACTION","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-PERCEPTION","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","O"]},{"tokens":["My","neighbor","Marco","knocked","at","6am","and","asked","if","I","wanted","his","old","bike."],"bio_tags":["O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-TEMPORAL","O","B-ACTION","O","B-PARTICIPANT","O","O","O","B-CONTENT"]},{"tokens":["I","told","him","I’d","think","about","it,","but","I","felt","nervous","for","some","reason."],"bio_tags":["B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","O","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","O","O"]},{"tokens":["Around","9,","I","noticed","the","bike’s","chain","was","tangled,","and","I","could","smell","rust."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","I-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-PERCEPTION","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-PERCEPTION","B-CONTENT"]},{"tokens":["I","spent","an","hour","with","the","chain,","and","then","my","cat","Juniper","curled","up","beside","me."],"bio_tags":["B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-TEMPORAL","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","B-T