{"entry_id":"2026-03-19-01","entry_timestamp":"2026-03-19T00:00:00Z","raw_text":"I met Jordan at the café after work, and I could tell he was stressed about the pitch. Then I walked home with my dog, and I thought maybe everything would feel calmer tomorrow.","nersamples":[{"tokens":["I","met","Jordan","at","the","café","after","work,","and","I","could","tell","he","was","stressed","about","the","pitch."],"bio_tags":["B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-PARTICIPANT","O","O","O","B-TEMPORAL","I-TEMPORAL","O","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-PERCEPTION","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","O"]},{"tokens":["Then","I","walked","home","with","my","dog,","and","I","thought","maybe","everything","would","feel","calmer","tomorrow."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-CONTENT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","I-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","O","O","B-TEMPORAL"]}],"sentence_ordering":[1,2]}
