{"entry_id":"diary_20260319_001","entry_timestamp":"2026-03-19T00:00:00Z","raw_text":"Yesterday I met Maya at the café, and I noticed her old map lying beside my coffee; maybe she planned the route for our walk, and I felt nervous until we left at 6.","nersamples":[{"tokens":["Yesterday","I","met","Maya","at","the","café,","and","I","noticed","her","old","map","lying","beside","my","coffee;","maybe","she","planned","the","route","for","our","walk,","and","I","felt","nervous","until","we","left","at","6."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-PARTICIPANT","O","O","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-PERCEPTION","O","O","B-CONTENT","B-ACTION","O","O","O","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","B-ACTION","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-TEMPORAL"]}],"sentence_ordering":[1]}
{"entry_id":"2026-03-19-001","entry_timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:12:00Z","raw_text":"This morning I overslept and texted Maya. At noon we grabbed ramen, and I felt weirdly proud. Later, I noticed the cat watching me from the window, and I thought maybe it wanted snacks. Then I decided to plan tomorrow carefully.","nersamples":[{"tokens":["This","morning","I","overslept","and","texted","Maya","."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","I-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-ACTION","B-PARTICIPANT","O"]},{"tokens":["At","noon","we","grabbed","ramen",",","and","I","felt","weirdly","proud","."] ,"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","I-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-CONTENT","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","O"]},{"tokens":["Later",",","I","noticed","the","cat","watching","me","from","the","window",",","and","I","thought","maybe","it","wanted","snacks","."] ,"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-PERCEPTION","O","B-PARTICIPANT","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","I-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","B-CONTENT","O"]},{"tokens":["Then","I","decided","to","plan","tomorrow","carefully","."] ,"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-ACTION","B-TEMPORAL","O","O"]}],"sentence_ordering":[1,2,3,4]}
{"entry_id":"d1","entry_timestamp":"2026-03-19T00:00:00Z","raw_text":"Yesterday, I helped Maya carry the groceries home, and I think the bus schedule is finally fixed, though I heard it was messy before.","nersamples":[{"tokens":["Yesterday,", "I","helped","Maya","carry","the","groceries","home,","and","I","think","the","bus","schedule","is","finally","fixed,","though","I","heard","it","was","messy","before."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-CONTENT","I-CONTENT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","B-CONTENT","I-CONTENT","O","B-TEMPORAL","O","O","O","B-PERCEPTION","O","O","O","B-TEMPORAL"]}],"sentence_ordering":[1]}
{"entry_id":"diary_20260319_001","entry_timestamp":"2026-03-19T00:00:00Z","raw_text":"Today I walked to the river with Maya and her old bike. I heard the water moving under the bridge and it made me smile. After lunch, Dad texted that he’d be late, and I felt weirdly relieved. I thought I should stop at the corner shop, but the line looked endless. Then I noticed a heron standing still near the reeds. I bought apples and candles, and the clerk asked my name. Next week I’m going to host a small dinner, and I’m kind of excited. Maya promised to help me set everything up. I realized the heron was staring at my reflection, which sounds silly, but it happened. Tonight I’m tired, so I’ll write more tomorrow.","nersamples":[{"tokens":["Today","I","walked","to","the","river","with","Maya","and","her","old","bike","."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","O","O","O","O","O"]},{"tokens":["I","heard","the","water","moving","under","the","bridge","and","it","made","me","smile","."],"bio_tags":["B-PARTICIPANT","B-PERCEPTION","O","B-CONTENT","I-CONTENT","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","O","O"]},{"tokens":["After","lunch",",","Dad","texted","that","he’d","be","late",",","and","I","felt","weirdly","relieved","."] ,"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-TEMPORAL","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-CONTENT","I-CONTENT","I-CONTENT","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","B-BELIEF_CUE","O"]},{"tokens":["I","thought","I","should","stop","at","the","corner","shop",",","but","the","line","looked","endless","."] ,"bio_tags":["B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-ACTION","O","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","O"]},{"tokens":["Then","I","noticed","a","heron","standing","still","near","the","reeds","."] ,"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-PERCEPTION","O","O","O","O","O","O","B-CONTENT","O"]},{"tokens":["I","bought","apples","and","candles",",","and","the","clerk","asked","my","name",