{"entry_id":"diary_20260319_001","entry_timestamp":"2026-03-19T00:00:00Z","raw_text":"This morning I checked the weather and promised myself I'd walk to the library. Later, Mara handed me a sticky note with the address, and I felt oddly relieved. When I got to the corner, I noticed my phone was at 5% and I panicked for a second. Then I thought maybe I left it on the bus, so I decided to retrace my steps anyway. After dinner, I finally remembered where I'd set it down and I sighed with relief.","nersamples":[{"tokens":["This","morning","I","checked","the","weather","and","promised","myself","I'd","walk","to","the","library","."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","I-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-CONTENT","O","B-ACTION","O","O","B-ACTION","O","O","B-CONTENT","O"]},{"tokens":["Later,","Mara","handed","me","a","sticky","note","with","the","address",",","and","I","felt","oddly","relieved","."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-PARTICIPANT","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","B-BELIEF_CUE","O"]},{"tokens":["When","I","got","to","the","corner",",","I","noticed","my","phone","was","at","5%","and","I","panicked","for","a","second","."],"bio_tags":["O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-PERCEPTION","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","O","O"]},{"tokens":["Then","I","thought","maybe","I","left","it","on","the","bus",",","so","I","decided","to","retrace","my","steps","anyway","."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","I-BELIEF_CUE","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-ACTION","O","B-CONTENT","O","O"]},{"tokens":["After","dinner",",","I","finally","remembered","where","I'd","set","it","down","and","I","sighed","with","relief","."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","I-TEMPORAL","O","O","B-ACTION","O","O","O","B-ACTION","O","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-BE