{"entry_id":"diary_20260319_001","entry_timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:00:00Z","raw_text":"Yesterday I met Dr. Patel at the café. Later, Mira introduced me to her new rescue dog, Toto, and we walked in the rain. I heard Toto whine when Dr. Patel opened the clinic door, and I realized I was worried. Then I decided maybe we should volunteer next week, because I assumed it would help strangers feel safer. I wrote everything down on my phone, and the whole thing felt oddly hopeful.","nersamples":[{"tokens":["Yesterday","I","met","Dr.","Patel","at","the","café","."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-PARTICIPANT","I-PARTICIPANT","O","O","B-CONTENT","O"]},{"tokens":["Later,","Mira","introduced","me","to","her","new","rescue","dog,","Toto,","and","we","walked","in","the","rain","."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-PARTICIPANT","O","O","O","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","O","O","O"]},{"tokens":["I","heard","Toto","whine","when","Dr.","Patel","opened","the","clinic","door,","and","I","realized","I","was","worried","."],"bio_tags":["B-PARTICIPANT","B-PERCEPTION","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-PARTICIPANT","I-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","B-BELIEF_CUE","O"]},{"tokens":["Then","I","decided","maybe","we","should","volunteer","next","week,","because","I","assumed","it","would","help","strangers","feel","safer","."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-BELIEF_CUE","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-ACTION","B-TEMPORAL","I-TEMPORAL","O","O","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","B-ACTION","O","B-ACTION","O","O"]},{"tokens":["I","wrote","everything","down","on","my","phone,","and","the","whole","thing","felt","oddly","hopeful","."],"bio_tags":["B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-CONTENT","I-CONTENT","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","O","O","B-ACTION","O","B-BELIEF_CUE","O"]}],"sentence_ordering":[1,2,3,4,5]}
